description: RALPH status — summarize initiatives, milestones, and task progress
argument-hint: "[initiative ID]"
argument: initiative
argument-description: An initiative ID to filter by (optional)
---

Summarize RALPH progress using the `ralph` MCP tools.

Initiative filter (may be empty): {{args}}

1. Call `status` (with `initiative_id` if one was given above).
2. For each milestone, report its status and task counts. Call out:
   - `BLOCKED` tasks, with their reasons (`task_list` with status `BLOCKED`, then `task_get`);
   - `PROPOSED` tasks that still need articulation, suggesting {{if claudeCode}}`/ralph:articulate <milestone ID>`{{else}}{{cmd "articulate"}} for <milestone ID>{{end}};
   - milestones whose tasks are all `TODO`, which are ready for `ralph loop --milestone <ID>`.
3. Archived initiatives are hidden unless asked for; pass `include_archived` to include them. An archived initiative
   is read-only, so suggest unarchiving it before any change to it or to what it contains.
4. Suggest the single most useful next step.

Keep the summary short. Do not change anything.
